// CIR-DAG: @instruction_sync_fence
// CIR-DAG: @atomic_clear_exclusive
// LL-DAG: call {{.*}} @atomic_thread_fence_seq_cst
// LL-DAG: call {{.*}} @atomic_data_sync_fence_seq_cst
// LL-DAG: call {{.*}} @instruction_sync_fence
// LL-DAG: call {{.*}} @atomic_clear_exclusive
